ata-tn="pdp-spec-title">Materials and Techniques<!-- -->: </div><div class="dc-sassyFontBody dc-inline" data-tn="pdp-spec-materials-and-techniques"><span class="dc-inlineBlock dc-mr3px" data-tn="pdp-spec-detail-material"><a class="_1862016c dc-textLeft" href="/furniture/seating/chairs/material/leather/">Leather</a>,</span><span class="dc-inlineBlock" data-tn="pdp-spec-detail-material"><a class="_1862016c dc-textLeft" href="/furniture/seating/chairs/material/steel/">Steel</a></span></div></li><li class="_762e74f4 dc-breakInsideAvoid dc-mbXsmall"><div class="dc-textNoir dc-sassyFontBodyTypeHeavy dc-inline" data-tn="pdp-spec-title">Place of Origin<!-- -->: </div><div class="dc-sassyFontBody dc-inline" data-tn="pdp-spec-place-of-origin"><span class="dc-inlineBlock" data-tn="pdp-spec-detail-origin"><a class="_1862016c dc-textLeft" href="/furniture/seating/chairs/origin/british/">United Kingdom</a></span></div></li><li class="_762e74f4 dc-breakInsideAvoid dc-mbXsmall"><div class="dc-textNoir dc-sassyFontBodyTypeHeavy dc-inline" data-tn="pdp-spec-title">Period<!-- -->: </div><div class="dc-sassyFontBody dc-inline" data-tn="pdp-spec-period"><span class="dc-inlineBlock" data-tn="pdp-spec-detail-period"><span class="dc-textLeft">1980-1989</span></span></div></li><li class="_762e74f4 dc-breakInsideAvoid dc-mbXsmall"><div class="dc-textNoir dc-sassyFontBodyTypeHeavy dc-inline" data-tn="pdp-spec-title">Date of Manufacture<!-- -->: </div><div class="dc-sassyFontBody dc-inline" data-tn="pdp-spec-date-of-manufacture"><span class="dc-inlineBlock" data-tn="pdp-spec-detail-dateOfManufacture"><span class="dc-textLeft">1981</span></span></div></li><li class="_762e74f4 dc-breakInsideAvoid dc-mbXsmall"><div class="dc-textNoir dc-sassyFontBodyTypeHeavy dc-inline" data-tn="pdp-spec-title">Condition<!-- -->: </div><div class="dc-sassyFontBody dc-inline" data-tn="pdp-spec-condition"><span class="dc-inlineBlock dc-mr3px" data-tn="pdp-spec-detail-condition"><button class="_1862016c dc-textLeft" data-tn="open-condition-modal" type="button">Good</button></span><span class="dc-inlineBlock" data-tn="pdp-spec-detail-conditionDetails"><span class="dc-textLeft">Wear consistent with age and use.</span></span><div></div></div></li><li class="_762e74f4 dc-breakInsideAvoid dc-mbXsmall"><div class="dc-textNoir dc-sassyFontBodyTypeHeavy dc-inline" data-tn="pdp-spec-title">Seller Location<!-- -->: </div><div class="dc-sassyFontBody dc-inline" data-tn="pdp-spec-seller-location"><span class="dc-inlineBlock" data-tn="pdp-spec-detail-sellerLocation"><span class="dc-textLeft">Longdon, GB</span></span></div></li><li class="_762e74f4 dc-breakInsideAvoid dc-mbXsmall"><div class="dc-textNoir dc-sassyFontBodyTypeHeavy dc-inline" data-tn="pdp-spec-title">Reference Number<!-- -->: </div><div class="dc-sassyFontBody dc-inline" data-tn="pdp-spec-reference-number"><span class="dc-block dc-breakAll" data-tn="pdp-spec-detail-referenceNumber"><span class="dc-textLeft">1stDibs: LU1832315007202</span></span></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="_6c97a9ff" tabindex="-1" hidden="" role="tabpanel" data-tn="tab-panel-Designer"><div><div class="_ca6163f4 _2bc31" data-tn="designer-tab-content"><div class="_afe4d64a"><div class="_df7618f5 _e675cbbc"><div class="_bb94cb6f"><img alt="" sizes="20vw" src="https://a.1stdibscdn.com/sculptural-postmodern-ringoletto-vase-by-ron-arad-for-rosenthal-2000s-for-sale/f_77932/f_462560721755102043153/f_46256072_1755102043463_bg_processed.jpg?width=520" class="_52782f5c" srcSet="https://a.1stdibscdn.com/sculptural-postmodern-ringoletto-vase-by-ron-arad-for-rosenthal-2000s-for-sale/f_77932/f_462560721755102043153/f_46256072_1755102043463_bg_processed.jpg?width=200&amp;disable=upscale&amp;auto=webp&amp;quality=60 200w, https://a.1stdibscdn.com/sculptural-postmodern-ringoletto-vase-by-ron-arad-for-rosenthal-2000s-for-sale/f_77932/f_462560721755102043153/f_46256072_1755102043463_bg_processed.jpg?width=320&amp;disable=upscale&amp;auto=webp&amp;quality=60 320w, https://a.1stdibscdn.com/sculptural-postmodern-ringoletto-vase-by-ron-arad-for-rosenthal-2000s-for-sale/f_77932/f_462560721755102043153/f_46256072_1755102043463_bg_processed.jpg?width=400&amp;disable=upscale&amp;auto=webp&amp;quality=60 400w, https://a.1stdibscdn.com/sculptural-postmodern-ringoletto-vase-by-ron-arad-for-rosenthal-2000s-for-sale/f_77932/f_462560721755102043153/f_46256072_1755102043463_bg_processed.jpg?width=640&amp;disable=upscale&amp;auto=webp&amp;quality=60 640w, https://a.1stdibscdn.com/sculptural-postmodern-ringoletto-vase-by-ron-arad-for-rosenthal-2000s-for-sale/f_77932/f_462560721755102043153/f_46256072_1755102043463_bg_processed.jpg?width=800&amp;disable=upscale&amp;auto=webp&amp;quality=60 800w, https://a.1stdibscdn.com/sculptural-postmodern-ringoletto-vase-by-ron-arad-for-rosenthal-2000s-for-sale/f_77932/f_462560721755102043153/f_46256072_1755102043463_bg_processed.jpg?width=960&amp;disable=upscale&amp;auto=webp&amp;quality=60 960w"/></div><a href="/creators/ron-arad/" data-tn="pdp-storytelling-shop-all-link" class="" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Shop All Ron Arad</a></div><div class="_f1790179"><div class="_64c09141"><h2 data-tn="pdp-storytelling-creator-name" class="_b935b9f2">Ron Arad</h2></div><div class="_3365e240"><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="/creators/ron-arad/furniture/">Ron Arad</a> was born in Tel Aviv, Israel, in 1951 and studied at the Jerusalem Academy of Art (1971–73) and the Architectural Association in London (1974–79). In 1989, he and Caroline Thorman founded Ron Arad Associates. Arad has exhibited at many major museums and galleries throughout the world and his work is considered definitive within public collections of contemporary design, including those at the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.centrepompidou.fr/en/">Centre Georges Pompidou</a>, Paris; <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.metmuseum.org/">Metropolitan Museum of Art</a>, N.Y; <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.vam.ac.uk/">Victoria &amp; Albert Museum</a>, London and the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.design-museum.de/en/information.html">Vitra Design Museum</a>, among many others.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="_6c97a9ff" tabindex="-1" hidden="" role="tabpanel" data-tn="tab-panel-BUYER_INCENTIVES"><!--$?--><template id="B:0"></template><!--/$--></div></div></div></div><div class="_ec73dfc3"></div><div class="_c8a37ba0"><div><div><div class="dc-maxW1440px dc-my0 dc-mxAuto" data-tn="pdp-similar-recommendation-grid"><div tabindex="-1" class="_dacb43a6"><div class="_ae40152a _b6c2f2a9"><h2 data-tn="header-title-dlos-header" data-heading="true" class="_32ed2fb3 _95165b0e">You May Also Like</h2></div><div class="_94dde1bc" data-tn="pdp-similar-items"><div></div><div class="rowFlex"><div class="colLg3 colMd6 colXs6 _7c0b8025"><article class="_aa62a1f1 dc-relative dc-boxBorder dc-flex dc-flexCol dc-wFull dc-minW0 _e12a332a" data-tn="item-tile-wrapper" data-tile-index="0"><a tabindex="0" data-tn="product-image-link" class="dc-wFull"><div class="dc-flex dc-justifyCenter dc-itemsCenter dc-wAuto dc-m0 dc-bgMoonstone _3a0bf712" data-tn="product-image-container"><img class="dc-objectContain dc-wFull dc-hFull dc-pXsmall _5cb3eaca" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=" alt="Ron Arad Chair" draggable="false" data-tn="product-image-not-lazy-loaded"/><noscript><img class="dc-objectContain dc-wFull dc-hFull dc-pXsmall _5cb3eaca" src="https://a.1stdibscdn.com/ron-arad-chair-for-sale/1121189/f_106045411525352195802/10604541_master.jpg?width=240" alt="Ron Arad Chair" srcSet="https://a.1stdibscdn.com/ron-arad-chair-for-sale/1121189/f_106045411525352195802/10604541_master.jpg?disable=upscale&amp;auto=webp&amp;quality=60&amp;width=200 200w, https://a.1stdibscdn.com/ron-arad-chair-for-sale/1121189/f_106045411525352195802/10604541_master.jpg?